==Strategy==
Bring a spammable Area Attacker such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] to deal with the constant Doge Darks and a ranged attacker such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] to deal hits on Martin. Make sure to bring a few meatshields as well to defend against Martin.

